Package: reach.meteo
Title: Dispatch-First Access to Met Office Forecast Data
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Payne", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jon.payne@environment-agency.gov.uk")
Description: Discovers, filters, downloads and analyses Met Office forecast data from public object storage. Includes MOGREPS-UK internal-realisation reading, six-cycle time-lagged ensemble composition, point extraction, precipitation accumulation and ggplot2 visualisation.
